%N A401279 Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the number of ways that an integer partition of n can be reduced to the empty partition with exactly k Chomp moves.
%H A401279 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A401279/b401279.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1325</a> (rows 0..50)
%H A401279 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chomp">Chomp</a>.
%F A401279 T(n,k) <= A393310(n,k-1) for k > 0.
